from lesson_helpers import example as ex
DATA={
'sha':'06bbb8bbe52f553ff4367c590ee133ce3dea64bd','colour':'#5453a4','first':'AnalyticStatistics',
'subtitle':('从仿真曲线到带资格的指标、判定与输出文件','From simulation traces to qualified metrics, verdicts and output files'),
'intro':[
('EvaluationLibrary 为已经存在的仿真信号增加只读观测层。它计算数值指标、检查明确需求、比较配对结果，并把结果组织为表格、综合判定、CSV、文本或命令台输出。数值与支持该数值的证据状态同时保留。','EvaluationLibrary adds a read-only observation layer to existing simulation signals. It calculates metrics, checks explicit requirements, compares paired results and organises tables, aggregate verdicts, CSV, text or terminal output. Numerical values are retained alongside their evidence qualification.'),
('学习本库不能只学“哪个模块输出多少”。必须先定义观察什么、在哪个窗口观察、哪些输入有效、采样如何安排、什么条件算违规，然后才能解释结果。v0.3.1 新增恢复的结果输出链和完成日志也在本指南中单独讲解。','Learning this library requires more than knowing which block outputs a number. Define the quantity, observation window, validity, sampling and violation criterion before interpreting results. The reporting chain restored in v0.3.1 and its completion logs are covered explicitly.')],
'route':[
('先用 AnalyticStatistics 手算参考值，区分时间加权统计与显式采样统计。','Start with AnalyticStatistics and analytical reference values, distinguishing time-weighted from sampled statistics.'),
('学习 BoundsAndValidWitness 与 IncompleteWindow，正确理解有效性、完整性与违规证据。','Study BoundsAndValidWitness and IncompleteWindow to interpret validity, completeness and violation witnesses.'),
('按任务选择响应时间、配对比较或频域指标，并记录窗口和采样网格。','Choose response timing, paired comparison or frequency measures, recording windows and sample grids.'),
('最后接入 Results 表格与写出器，核对元数据、实际路径和 SUCCESS/SKIPPED 日志。','Connect Results tables and writers last, checking metadata, actual paths and SUCCESS/SKIPPED logs.')],
'concepts':[
(('有数值、已结束、完整和满足是四件事','A value, finalisation, completeness and satisfaction are different'),'valueAvailable 说明数值可解释；complete 说明观测已经结束；dataStatus=COMPLETE 说明覆盖符合规则；verdict=SATISFIED 还需要明确需求判据。不能将 complete=true 或数值不为零当成需求满足。','valueAvailable qualifies a numerical value. complete indicates finalisation. dataStatus=COMPLETE indicates adequate coverage. verdict=SATISFIED additionally requires an explicit requirement criterion. Neither complete=true nor a non-zero value establishes satisfaction.'),
(('状态与判定有独立枚举','Data status and verdict have separate enumerations'),'DataStatus 包含 PENDING、COMPLETE、INCOMPLETE、INVALID、NOT_APPLICABLE；Verdict 包含 UNDECIDED、SATISFIED、VIOLATED、INVALID、NOT_APPLICABLE。无效数据优先影响判定，但已观察到的 everViolated 与 firstViolationTime 可继续保留。','DataStatus contains PENDING, COMPLETE, INCOMPLETE, INVALID and NOT_APPLICABLE. Verdict contains UNDECIDED, SATISFIED, VIOLATED, INVALID and NOT_APPLICABLE. Invalid data take precedence in the verdict while an earlier everViolated witness and firstViolationTime can remain recorded.'),
(('窗口与内部采样定义证据范围','The window and internal sampling define evidence scope'),'固定窗口按 [windowStart,windowStop) 解释。ExternalSingle 只接受第一个外部窗口，再次开启会标为无效。samplePeriod 和 sampleStart 定义内部采样；求解器输出 Interval 只是结果保存网格，两者不能混同。','Fixed windows use [windowStart,windowStop). ExternalSingle accepts the first external window and flags a later reopening as invalid. samplePeriod and sampleStart define internal sampling; solver output Interval is a result-recording grid, not the same mechanism.'),
(('终点前未响应不一定已经超时','An unanswered request at observation end is not necessarily a timeout'),'请求尚未达到 deadline 就遇到观测终点，属于删失：不知道它之后能否及时响应。RepeatedResponse 使用有限队列区分匹配、超时、未匹配响应与删失；这些计数不能合并成一种失败。','A request whose deadline lies after observation end is censored: timely future response is unknown. RepeatedResponse uses a finite queue to distinguish matches, timeouts, unmatched responses and censoring. These are not interchangeable failure counts.'),
(('元数据不会随连接器自动全部传递','Not all metadata travel through the connector'),'MetricInput/MetricOutput 传递数值、状态、判定和若干覆盖字段；metricId、unitName、requirementVersion 与窗口元数据由 ResultTable 或写出器参数提供。两处要显式保持一致。v0.3.1 的 records.observedDuration 设为 0 占位，因为连接器没有该字段；它不是测得的观测时长。','MetricInput/MetricOutput carry values, status, verdict and selected coverage fields. metricId, unitName, requirementVersion and window metadata are parameters of ResultTable or writers and must be kept consistent explicitly. In v0.3.1, records.observedDuration is a zero placeholder because the connector lacks that field; it is not a measured duration.'),
(('输出完成日志不是仿真验证证据','A completion log is not simulation validation evidence'),'写出器默认在结果完成后执行一次；文件关闭并确认存在后才打印 SUCCESS，已有文件按 RejectExisting 跳过则打印 SKIPPED。generated_at 是运行主机当地时间，simulation_time 是仿真时刻。成功写文件只说明输出操作完成，不说明所有需求都通过。','Writers perform a one-shot action after result finalisation. SUCCESS follows file closure and existence confirmation; RejectExisting produces SKIPPED for an existing file. generated_at is host-local wall time and simulation_time is model time. Successful writing does not mean that all requirements passed.')],
'groups':[
('Signals',('信号预处理','Signal preparation'),'为相同单位、对齐的信号构造差值、绝对误差、相对误差或环绕角误差。有限差分须明确采样周期；相对误差要处理零或过小分母。预处理后的信号再送给统计或需求模块。','Prepare differences, absolute/relative error or wrapped angular error from aligned, unit-compatible signals. Declare finite-difference sampling and handle small denominators before passing the result to statistics or requirements.'),
('Statistics',('连续与采样统计','Continuous and sampled statistics'),'按问题选择 Integral、TimeMean/TimeRMS/TimeVariance 或 Sample 类；统一窗口与资格规则，并把 value 与 available/dataStatus 一起观察。积分单位包含时间，均值与输入同单位，方差为单位平方。','Choose integration, time-weighted or sampled statistics according to the question. Align window and validity rules and inspect value together with availability/status. Integral units include time, means retain input units and variance has squared units.'),
('Response',('动态响应与事件','Dynamic response and events'),'连接被观测响应或 request/response，声明参考值、阈值、stepTime、deadline、dwell 和采样规则。SettlingTime 要到完整窗口末端才能确认最终入带；事件类须检查计数、队列容量与删失。','Connect the observed response or request/response pair and declare references, levels, step time, deadline, dwell and sampling. SettlingTime confirms final band entry only at a complete window end. Inspect event counts, queue capacity and censoring.'),
('Requirements',('显式需求判定','Explicit requirement assessment'),'先写清上界、下界、带内、持续违规或截止时间要求，再设置对应参数。接入真实资格信号时启用 useValidInput；不要把未观测完但没有发现违规直接写成 SATISFIED。','Define an upper/lower bound, band, persistence or deadline requirement before setting parameters. Enable useValidInput for actual qualification. Do not report an unfinished observation with no witnessed violation as SATISFIED.'),
('Comparison',('配对比较与一致性','Paired comparison and consistency'),'连接语义可比的结果；单位、窗口、指标定义和优选方向由研究者确认。Improvement 的相对值是比例；参考值过小时需看 relativeAvailable。标签统计与多通道数值一致性是不同问题。','Connect semantically comparable results and verify units, windows, metric definitions and preferred direction. Relative improvement is a fraction and requires relativeAvailable for small baselines. Classification statistics differ from numeric channel consistency.'),
('Frequency',('有限窗口频域分析','Finite-window frequency analysis'),'明确 samplePeriod、nSamples、频率与窗设置，检查窗口能否收集完整样本。单频、谐波畸变、双信号增益相位和峰值衰减各有适用条件；不能把未填满的缓冲或任意非平稳片段解释为可靠频谱。','Declare sampling, sample count, frequencies and window settings and ensure full acquisition. Single-tone measures, distortion, two-signal gain/phase and peak decay have distinct assumptions. An unfilled buffer or arbitrary non-stationary segment is not a qualified spectrum.'),
('Results',('结果组织与输出','Result organisation and output'),'把评价器 result 接到 u[n]，配置各行标识、单位、窗口和需求版本。选择 CSVWriter、TextWriter 或 ConsoleWriter，outputDirectory 须已存在；默认不覆盖已有文件。PartialWriter 是抽象基类，不能单独实例化。','Connect evaluator result to u[n] and configure row identifiers, units, windows and requirement versions. Select a CSV, text or console writer. outputDirectory must exist and existing files are not overwritten by default. PartialWriter is a partial base, not a stand-alone component.')],
'examples':{
'AnalyticStatistics':ex(('斜坡的连续与采样统计','Continuous and sampled statistics of a ramp'),('为什么同一信号的时间均值与采样均值不完全相同？','Why do time and sample means differ for the same signal?'),('inputSignal.y=time，窗口 [0,2)，内部采样周期 0.01 s；连续积分和采样统计并行连接。','inputSignal.y=time is observed over [0,2), with 0.01 s internal sampling. Continuous and sampled statistics are connected in parallel.'),('连续积分为 2，时间均值 1，时间 RMS=2/√3，时间方差 1/3。采样点是 0 到 1.99 的 200 点，采样均值为 0.995；差异来自证据定义，不是求解器必然出错。','The integral is 2, time mean 1, time RMS 2/√3 and time variance 1/3. There are 200 sample points from 0 to 1.99, yielding sample mean 0.995. The difference follows the evidence definition, not necessarily a solver error.'),['integralValue','timeMeanValue','timeRMSValue','timeVarianceValue','sampleMeanValue','sampleMean.nValid','sampleRangeValue'],('把内部 samplePeriod 改为 0.1，再手算采样均值 0.95；另行修改输出网格，确认它不是同一个设置。','Set internal samplePeriod to 0.1 and calculate the expected sample mean 0.95. Change the output grid separately to distinguish the settings.'),('最终解释前先确认窗口已结束且数据有效；运行中输出是尚在积累的量。','Confirm finalisation and qualification before interpreting the final result; values during execution are still accumulating.')),
'BoundsAndValidWitness':ex(('保留违规证据而不掩盖后续无效数据','Retain a witness without hiding later invalidity'),('先发生有效违规，之后数据失效，最终应怎样报告？','How should a valid violation followed by invalid data be reported?'),('两个上界为 1.2 的评价器观察 t，其中一个在 [1.6,1.7) s 失去资格；第三个上界为 3。共同窗口结束于 2 s。','Two upper bounds of 1.2 observe t, with one becoming invalid over [1.6,1.7) s. A third upper bound is 3. All windows end at 2 s.'),('一直有效的支路为 VIOLATED；有失效段的支路为 INVALID，但仍保留在约 1.2 s 越界的 everViolated 与 firstViolationTime；第三支路为 SATISFIED。','The always-valid branch is VIOLATED. The gapped branch is INVALID while retaining the witness near 1.2 s and firstViolationTime. The third branch is SATISFIED.'),['alwaysValid.dataStatus','alwaysValid.verdict','withGap.dataStatus','withGap.verdict','withGap.everViolated','withGap.firstViolationTime','passing.verdict'],('把无效段提前到越界前，比较是否仍有合格违规证据；分别报告数据状态和判定。','Move the invalid interval before the crossing and compare qualified witnesses, reporting status and verdict separately.'),('INVALID 不能抹去真实已有的违规，也不能因为存在违规就把所有后续数据称为有效。','INVALID does not erase an earlier valid witness, and a witness does not qualify all subsequent data.')),
'FirstOrderResponse':ex(('上升时间与终点稳定时间','Rise time and terminal settling time'),('响应第一次入带为何不一定就是最终稳定时间？','Why is the first band entry not necessarily final settling?'),('0.5 s 的单位阶跃驱动 T=0.5 一阶本体，评价窗口为 [0.5,4)。上升时间使用声明的阈值，稳定时间使用目标 1、误差带 0.02 和最短驻留。','A unit step at 0.5 s drives a first-order host with T=0.5 over [0.5,4). Rise time uses declared levels; settling uses target 1, band 0.02 and a minimum dwell.'),('默认 10%–90% 上升时间解析值为 0.5 ln(9)≈1.0986 s；2% 带的入带时延为 0.5 ln(50)≈1.9560 s。最终稳定资格须在完整窗口结束时确认，而不是首次入带就立即证明。','The default 10–90% rise time is 0.5 ln(9)≈1.0986 s. Entry into the 2% band occurs after 0.5 ln(50)≈1.9560 s. Final settling qualification requires the complete window end, not merely first entry.'),['plant.y','riseSeconds','settlingSeconds','settling.settled','settling.dataStatus'],('缩短 windowStop，使末段驻留不足；观察数值可用性与 settled 如何变化。','Shorten windowStop so that terminal dwell is insufficient and inspect availability and settled.'),('这里的解析比较依赖单调一阶响应；振荡响应可能反复进出误差带。','The analytical comparison uses a monotonic first-order response; an oscillatory response can enter and leave repeatedly.')),
'RepeatedRequestResponse':ex(('匹配、超时与删失分开计数','Separate matching, timeout and censoring'),('观测结束前发出的最后一个请求是否应该算超时？','Should the last request before observation end count as a timeout?'),('请求在 1、2、3、3.95 s；响应在 0.5、1.1、2.15 s；deadline=0.2 s，观测截止 4 s。','Requests occur at 1, 2, 3 and 3.95 s; responses at 0.5, 1.1 and 2.15 s. Deadline is 0.2 s and observation ends at 4 s.'),('1 与 2 s 的请求分别以 0.1 和 0.15 s 匹配；3 s 请求超时；3.95 s 请求在到达截止期限前观测结束，因此删失。0.5 s 响应没有对应请求。预期 matched=2、timedOut=1、censored=1、unmatchedResponse=1。','The first two requests match after 0.1 and 0.15 s. The 3 s request times out. Observation ends before the 3.95 s request deadline, so it is censored. The 0.5 s response is unmatched: expected counts are 2 matches, 1 timeout, 1 censored request and 1 unmatched response.'),['paired.matched','paired.timedOut','paired.censored','paired.unmatchedResponse','requirement.verdict'],('把窗口延长到 4.3 s，比较最后请求从删失转为超时的条件。','Extend the window to 4.3 s and inspect when the final request becomes a timeout rather than censored.'),('没有响应和已超时不是同一事实；队列容量不足还可能使证据无效。','No response and an elapsed deadline are different facts; queue overflow can also invalidate evidence.')),
'PairedPerformance':ex(('完整可比积分的改进量','Improvement between complete comparable integrals'),('怎样明确“变小是好还是坏”，并避免零分母误读？','How can preferred direction and denominator validity be made explicit?'),('基准为 t，候选为 0.8t，同在 [0,2) 积分；Improvement 使用声明的配对标识、单位和窗口，以及默认 LowerIsBetter。','Baseline is t and candidate 0.8t, both integrated over [0,2). Improvement uses declared comparison metadata and default LowerIsBetter.'),('基准积分 2、候选 1.6；absoluteChange=0.4，relativeChange=0.2，即 20% 而不是数值 20。相对值还须 relativeAvailable=true。','Baseline integral is 2 and candidate 1.6. absoluteChange=0.4 and relativeChange=0.2, meaning 20%, not the number 20. Relative interpretation also requires relativeAvailable=true.'),['absoluteChange','relativeChange','improvement.available','improvement.relativeAvailable'],('把 sense 改为 HigherIsBetter，观察符号变化；另做接近零基准的实验。','Change sense to HigherIsBetter and inspect the sign, then separately test a near-zero baseline.'),('数学上可相减不等于工程上可比较；元数据和指标定义需要研究者保持一致。','Mathematical subtraction does not establish engineering comparability; the researcher must align definitions and metadata.')),
'ConsistencyAndLabels':ex(('分类准确率与数值一致性','Classification accuracy and numerical consistency'),('为什么通道彼此一致不能证明分类判断正确？','Why does channel consistency not establish classification correctness?'),('四个标签采样时刻为 0.5、1.5、2.5、3.5 s；truth 在 2 s 变真，decision 在 [1,3) 为真。另有三个恒定数值通道 1、2、3。','Labels are sampled at 0.5, 1.5, 2.5 and 3.5 s. truth becomes true at 2 s and decision is true over [1,3). Separate numerical channels are fixed at 1, 2 and 3.'),('四次分类依次产生 TN、FP、TP、FN，各计数为 1，accuracy=0.5。数值通道 spread=2，与上述分类对错不是同一个指标。','The samples produce TN, FP, TP and FN, each once, giving accuracy=0.5. The numerical spread is 2, which measures a different property.'),['accuracy','labels.TP','labels.TN','labels.FP','labels.FN','spread'],('改变 decision 的时间窗，手算混淆矩阵；再单独改变第三个数值通道。','Change the decision window and calculate the confusion matrix, then vary the third numerical channel separately.'),('样本数量与采样相位会影响统计；没有类别样本时相关比例的分母可能不可用。','Sample count and sampling phase affect statistics; ratios may be unavailable when a class has no observations.')),
'HarmonicMeasurements':ex(('相干采样窗口中的两个频率','Two coherent tones in a finite sample window'),('完整采样窗如何支撑谱幅值和谐波畸变？','How does a complete sample window support amplitudes and harmonic distortion?'),('输入为 5 Hz、幅值 1 的正弦加上 10 Hz、幅值 0.1 的正弦；nSamples=200、samplePeriod=0.01、windowStop=2。','The input combines a 5 Hz sine of amplitude 1 and a 10 Hz sine of amplitude 0.1, using 200 samples at 0.01 s over a 2 s window.'),('采样频率 100 Hz、频率间隔 0.5 Hz；两个频率都与网格相干。基频幅值应约 1，二次谐波约 0.1；THD 比例约 0.1，即 10%。同时检查缓冲完成与数据资格。','Sampling frequency is 100 Hz and frequency spacing 0.5 Hz; both tones are coherent with the grid. Fundamental amplitude should be about 1, second harmonic about 0.1 and THD about 0.1, or 10%. Inspect acquisition completion and qualification.'),['spectrum.amplitude','fundamentalValue','distortion.thd','distortionValue'],('把频率改为不落在网格上的值，观察有限窗泄漏；再改变采样周期，检查 Nyquist 边界。','Move a tone off the grid and inspect finite-window leakage, then change the sampling period and check the Nyquist limit.'),('相干纯正弦案例不保证任意非平稳信号都能得到相同精度的幅相解释。','A coherent sinusoidal example does not guarantee equally accurate amplitude/phase interpretation for arbitrary non-stationary signals.')),
'DecayMeasurement':ex(('正峰值衰减比','Positive-peak decay ratio'),('怎样把衰减振荡转成峰值比，而不把每个样本都当成峰？','How is decay measured from peaks rather than every sample?'),('输入 exp(-t) sin(2π·5t)，采样周期 0.001 s，窗口终止于 3 s；模块识别合格的正峰值。','The input is exp(-t) sin(2π·5t), sampled every 0.001 s until 3 s. The component identifies qualified positive peaks.'),('相邻同类峰相隔约 0.2 s，因此解析幅值比约 exp(-0.2)=0.81873，对数减量约 0.2；离散采样识别会引入小偏差。','Successive like-signed peaks are about 0.2 s apart, so the analytical ratio is exp(-0.2)=0.81873 and logarithmic decrement about 0.2. Discrete peak identification introduces small differences.'),['decayingWave.y','peakRatio','decay.peakCount','decay.ratio','decay.logarithmicDecrement'],('逐步加大 samplePeriod，观察漏峰或峰值估计误差。','Increase samplePeriod progressively and inspect missed peaks or amplitude error.'),('只有足够合格峰值才有比值意义；噪声、多频和变频需要额外分析。','The ratio requires sufficient qualified peaks; noise, multiple tones and changing frequency need additional interpretation.')),
'IncompleteWindow':ex(('正常结束但观测未完整','Normal termination with incomplete observation'),('正常终止仿真能否直接得到满足结论？','Does normal simulation termination imply satisfaction?'),('两个评价器都要求观察到 2 s，但该示例在 1 s 正常停止；上界分别为 3 与 0.5。','Both evaluators request observation until 2 s, but the example normally terminates at 1 s. Upper bounds are 3 and 0.5.'),('两者最终 complete 可以为真而 dataStatus=INCOMPLETE。无违规证据的支路保持 UNDECIDED；另一个保留约 0.5 s 的违规并判为 VIOLATED。','Both can finalise with complete=true and dataStatus=INCOMPLETE. The branch without a witness remains UNDECIDED; the other retains the violation near 0.5 s and is VIOLATED.'),['noWitness.complete','noWitness.dataStatus','noWitness.verdict','withWitness.dataStatus','withWitness.verdict','withWitness.everViolated'],('把 StopTime 延长到 2.1，比较完整覆盖后无违规支路的判定。','Extend StopTime to 2.1 and inspect the no-violation branch after complete coverage.'),('此处研究正常 terminal 事件，不声称异常崩溃或强杀进程也能完成同样的收尾。','This examines normal terminal handling, not a guarantee of identical finalisation after crashes or forced process termination.')),
'ResultAggregationAndFiles':ex(('三种结果的聚合与文件输出','Aggregate three verdicts and export results'),('怎样把通过、违规、无效三条结果保留下来并知道文件生成在哪里？','How can satisfied, violated and invalid results be preserved with a known export location?'),('三条 UpperBound 在 2 s 完成：passing 上界 3，violating 上界 1，invalid 上界 3 但中间失去资格；table 分发到 aggregate 和 CSV、TXT、console 三种写出器。','Three UpperBound instances finalise at 2 s: passing has upper 3, violating upper 1, and invalid upper 3 with a qualification gap. table distributes them to aggregate and three writers.'),('预期三个记录依次表达满足、违规与无效；综合判定 INVALID，但保留子项违规证据。文件名为 demo_csv.csv 和 demo_text.txt，控制台还打印结果及带绝对路径的完成日志。重复运行保留文件时应打印 SKIPPED。','The three records should express satisfaction, violation and invalidity. Aggregate verdict is INVALID while retaining a child witness. Files are demo_csv.csv and demo_text.txt; terminal output includes results and completion logs with absolute paths. A repeat run retaining files should report SKIPPED.'),['table.complete','aggregate.verdict','aggregate.everViolated','aggregate.firstViolationTime','csv.written','csv.skippedExisting','text.written'],('先在新目录运行，再原目录重复运行；随后明确选择 Overwrite，检查日志动作与文件内容。同步修改 table 和 writer 的标识元数据。','Run in a fresh directory, repeat without deleting files, then explicitly select Overwrite and inspect both logs and content. Update table and writer metadata together.'),('v0.3.1 的结果组件已在源码层恢复，但本次没有重新编译仿真；必须在目标工具运行后再将输出视为实际验证。成功写文件也不意味着综合判定 SATISFIED。','The v0.3.1 reporting components are restored at source level but were not compiled or simulated in this documentation work. Verify them in the target tool. Successful file writing does not imply SATISFIED.'))
},
'study':[
('先把研究要求写成可检查的量、窗口、阈值和有效性规则，再选对应评价器。保留指标值、状态、判定、首次违规和覆盖信息。对于对照实验，尽量让基准与候选共用同一窗口和输入定义。','Express the research requirement as quantity, window, criterion and validity rule before choosing an evaluator. Preserve value, status, verdict, first violation and coverage. Use matching windows and inputs for baseline–candidate comparisons.'),
('下方模型从零连接一个上界需求和 CSV 写出器。输出目录默认是仿真进程工作目录，不保证等于源码目录；以控制台 destination 日志为准。不要把重复运行的 SKIPPED 当成新结果生成。','The model below connects an upper-bound requirement to a CSV writer. The default directory is the simulation process working directory, not necessarily the source directory; use the logged destination. SKIPPED on a repeated run is not a newly generated result.')],
'snippet':'''within;
model MyBoundReport
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression signal(y=time);
  EvaluationLibrary.Requirements.UpperBound limit(upper=1, windowStop=2);
  EvaluationLibrary.Results.CSVWriter report(
    n=1, metricId={"upper-limit"}, requirementVersion={"1.0"},
    windowStart={0}, windowStop={2}, runId="study", resultSetId="checks");
equation
  connect(signal.y, limit.u);
  connect(limit.result, report.u[1]);
  annotation(experiment(StopTime=2.1, Tolerance=1e-6));
end MyBoundReport;''',
 'trouble':[
(('结果数值为零但 available=false','The result is zero but unavailable'),'零可能是占位值。读取 valueAvailable 或 available，再结合 dataStatus；同样，firstViolationTime=0 且 everViolated=false 不代表 t=0 已违规。','Zero can be a placeholder. Inspect availability and dataStatus. Similarly, firstViolationTime=0 with everViolated=false does not mean a violation occurred at t=0.'),
(('complete=true 为什么不满足','Why does complete=true not imply satisfaction?'),'complete 是收尾状态。提前终止、无效输入或没有需求判据都可能使最终结果不是 SATISFIED；检查 dataStatus 与 verdict 的独立字段。','complete indicates finalisation. Early termination, invalid inputs or the absence of a requirement criterion can prevent SATISFIED; inspect status and verdict separately.'),
(('没有生成新文件','Why was no new file generated?'),'检查所有 u[i].complete 是否达到 true、输出目录是否已存在、文件策略是否跳过已有文件、以及实际仿真工作目录。ConsoleWriter 本来就不创建文件。','Check all input completion flags, directory existence, existing-file policy and the actual simulation working directory. ConsoleWriter intentionally creates no file.'),
(('文件中的单位或窗口与指标不同','Exported units or windows differ from the metric'),'这些元数据来自写出器参数，不自动从数值连接器推断。应由同一实验配置显式设置，并在导出前审查，而不是让文件名替代需求追溯。','Writer parameters supply this metadata; it is not inferred from the numeric connector. Set it from a common experiment configuration and review it before export; a filename does not provide requirement traceability.'),
(('可以用一次仿真证明系统安全吗','Can one simulation prove system safety?'),'本库判定只对已建模本体、已执行场景、已声明窗口和资格规则成立。模型保真度、未覆盖场景和工程认证是另一个层面的证据。','Verdicts apply to the model, executed scenario, declared window and qualification rules. Model fidelity, unexamined scenarios and engineering certification require separate evidence.')]
}
